[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta + 117i\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4(\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta)} = \frac{96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4} = 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m 3. **Combine the real and imaginary parts**: Adding the real parts of the two expressions, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 4 \cdot 75\cos\theta - 4 \cdot 117\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m 4. **Maximize the real part**: To find the maximum value of \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\), we can use the fact that the maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 324\) and \(b = -432\), so the maximum value is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    \sqrt{324^2 + (-432)^2} = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 186624} = \sqrt{291600} = 540
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m    \]
