[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} (\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = 24(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) + 36i(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)
