[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m The real part of this expression is \(324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta\). To find the maximum value of this expression, we can use the fact that the maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 324\) and \(b = -468\), so the maximum value is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1724981)[0m \[
